    "summary_en": "Vanke expects a net loss attributable to shareholders of RMB 10.0-12.0 billion for H1 2025 (January 1 to June 30, 2025), versus a loss of RMB 9.85 billion in the prior-year period. The net loss after non-recurring items is forecast at RMB 9.5-11.5 billion, and basic loss per share at RMB 0.8433-1.0120. The company attributes the loss to a sharp drop in property development settlements, low gross margins, higher new asset impairment provisions, and some asset and equity transactions priced below book value. The forecast is unaudited and preliminary, and the company reports H1 sales of RMB 69.11 billion and H1 financing of RMB 24.9 billion, excluding shareholder loans.",
